      "id": "claim_16d01659679c47ad866a44d45a3bfbf1",
      "statement": "ProviderResolver throws InvalidOperationException from its constructor for an empty provider list (\"At least one agent provider must be configured.\"), a case-insensitively duplicated provider name (\"Agent provider '<name>' is configured more than once.\"), an Agent.General.Provider that matches no entry (\"Agent provider '<name>' is not configured.\"), and an Endpoint that is not an absolute URI (\"Agent provider '<name>' has an invalid endpoint.\").",
