      "id": "claim_7aa73e5b0ae64763a8ed10d1fb6f7782",
      "statement": "Registration order is meaningful: Git is registered as a hosted service before JobQueue, so the repository/top-level guard runs before the queue starts consuming work, and the host does not route traffic until hosted services have started.",
