      "statement": "The startup main sync is deliberately not fail-fast: StartAsync links the start token to a 10-second timeout and SyncMainAsync swallows InvalidOperationException and OperationCanceledException as warnings, because a missed push delivery must not prevent startup; mirror problems (wrong branch, uncommitted tracked changes, commits ahead of origin/main) are instead rejected per job by FindMirrorProblemAsync inside PrepareWorkspaceAsync.",
