      "id": "claim_a0465ed06d074a0daf796cb638e17e0e",
      "statement": "Startup makes no model or GitHub network call: ProviderResolver only validates the configured shape and selects a provider/endpoint, while CreateChatClient constructs the OpenAI client and chat client per job, so a wrong-but-well-formed API key or model id fails inside a job run and not at boot.",
